EnergyCommunity.user.mobileApp.gui

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Provides the presentation layer and user interface for mobile client devices.
- Renders user dashboards (consumption, production, storage levels), alert notifications, and interactive decision views for approving or rejecting suggested action plans.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: PRESENTATION LAYER.
- Boundary Rule: Interacts solely with the mobile client layer (mobileApp), isolating UI rendering from network transport, device sensor handling, and backend state.
